1
00:00:00,120 --> 00:00:01,550
Use your best judgment.

2
00:00:01,550 --> 00:00:06,320
(Sheldon:)Well, I think I have a
nice 2009 AnaMantle HC.

3
00:00:06,320 --> 00:00:09,730
(Sheldon:)It's usually indicated for
acutely inflamed hemorrhoids,

4
00:00:09,730 --> 00:00:14,100
(Sheldon:)but it also goes nicely
with non-mucosal body parts.

5
00:00:14,970 --> 00:00:16,130
(Leonard:)Sounds great.

6
00:00:16,130 --> 00:00:17,770
(Sheldon:)Excellent choice.

7
00:00:19,490 --> 00:00:22,140
Okay, hurry, hurry, hurry.

8
00:00:23,010 --> 00:00:25,160
Come on, come on, come on.

9
00:00:26,080 --> 00:00:28,310
(Sheldon:)Priya?

10
00:00:29,080 --> 00:00:30,880
(Priya:)Good morning, Sheldon.

11
00:00:30,880 --> 00:00:35,380
(Sheldon:)For shame, Leonard, for shame.

12
00:00:35,390 --> 00:00:37,550
(Sheldon:)And to think,

13
00:00:37,550 --> 00:00:39,710
(Sheldon:)I was ready to waste

14
00:00:39,710 --> 00:00:43,730
(Sheldon:)the last of my good
hemorrhoid cream on you.

15
00:00:49,900 --> 00:00:52,620
(Leonard:)Making pretty
good time, huh?

16
00:00:52,690 --> 00:00:56,130
(Sheldon:)Is that really what you want
to talk about, Leonard?

17
00:00:56,130 --> 00:00:57,580
(Sheldon:)No.

18
00:00:57,580 --> 00:00:59,020
(Sheldon:)What do you want to talk about?

